      "message": "Test: Add legacy script edge cases to taproot test\n\nAdd feature_taproot spenders for script edge cases that other\nimplementations have gotten wrong: CSV with -2, a 5-byte operand whose\nvalue fits in 1 byte, IFDUP on negative or non-minimal zero, ROLL with\nduplicate values, and OP_16 in a P2SH scriptSig.\n\nEach case hits an already-covered branch, so the minimizer drops it,\nand none are caught by the current vectors. Naming them lets their\ndumps be added to the script assets.",
